# A kick far too weak to bleach anything: the fields obey linear equations with constant coefficients, and light sloshes between the cavities at the coupling rate while it decays.
# Reference: the closed form from the eigenmodes of the coupled cavities, within 0.2%.
title Dark regime: chain3
sites 3
path 1 3 kappa=0.1
kick 1 amplitude=0.001
run 45
expect total 0
expect count 1 0
expect count 2 0
expect count 3 0
expect intensity 1 6 1.14023754e-07 2e-3
expect intensity 2 6 4.65285274e-08 2e-3
expect intensity 3 6 4.74660716e-09 2e-3
expect intensity 3 15 6.44304264e-09 2e-3
expect intensity 1 22 7.18700631e-17 2e-3
expect total 0
